<title>USA: NCR buys 14.5 pct Turbon stake.</title>
<headline>NCR buys 14.5 pct Turbon stake.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>NCR Corp said Monday it has purchased a 14.5 percent equity stake in Turbon International AG for about $14.5 million.</p>
<p>Turbon, a publicly traded company headquartered in Hattingen, Germany, is a manufacturer of business equipment consumables for various printer products.</p>
<p>&quot;Turbon has been a major supplier to NCR for over ten years,&quot; said Dan Enneking, Senior Vice President of NCR Systemedia Group. NCR's Systemedia Group is a leader in producing and marketing supplies for information and transaction technology equipment.</p>
</text>
